OL,3,GNEWSADad to run three marathons in
OL,4,Amemory of son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is set to run three marathons in
OL,7,Fthree weeks to raise money in memory of
OL,8,Fhis young son who died from a brain
OL,9,Ftumour.
OL,11,FJax was diagnosed with the cancer in
OL,12,FJanuary 2021 just before he turned
OL,13,Fthree years old.
OL,15,FAfter having the tumour removed in
OL,16,FSouthampton, Jax had treatments in
OL,17,FManchester and London but the cancer
OL,18,Fkept coming back and in April 2026 he
OL,19,Fdied aged six.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
